From: Andreas Baierl <ichgeh@imkreisrum.de>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:18:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 44/59] Support stream events

addStreamEventListener() only stored the listener. Resolve the event
with the stream event description file, let VDR filter the component
and deliver the events with name, data, text and status. Events of
the object carousel (dvb: URLs) are reported as error.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
---
